      "text": [
        {
          "id": "editorial",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "HELD REGISTER · MATHEME · PAŚYANTĪ",
          "title": "Matheme",
          "italic": "the visionary operative logic",
          "body": "Matheme makes the relation transmissible through notation, derivation, construction and formal comparison — and is its own subject: the full equation `0/1 = 4+2 = 5→0 = 1/0 = 4′+2′ = 5′→0′ = 0/1`. Paśyantī: the visionary speech-moment of the one Vāk descent, more primordial than the mytheme.\nThis scene holds the register's presence and office inside Symbolon. The register's own records are carried by the Matheme Expression; they are referenced here, not restaged.\nSource of record: submission-package/essay/symbolon/README.md @ dbf3b17",
