          "id": "editorial",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "HELD REGISTER · MYTHEME · MADHYAMĀ",
          "title": "Mytheme",
          "italic": "the formed image",
          "body": "Mytheme lets the relation become lived and memorable through myth, narrative, poetry, media, art, music and composed plates. Its images perform operations; they do not stand as decorative equivalents of equations. Madhyamā: the formed visual and narrative operations built through the matheme's logic.\nThe register's whole stories are carried by the Mytheme Expression; held here as presence, referenced not restaged.\nSource of record: submission-package/essay/symbolon/README.md @ dbf3b17",
