          "kicker": "HELD REGISTER · EPISTEME · VAIKHARĪ",
          "title": "Episteme",
          "italic": "the inspected utterance",
          "body": "Episteme carries instituted knowledge: canonical source houses, histories, etymologies, MEF lenses, argument maps, comparative dossiers, evidential figures, concept nodes and dialogue records. It shows what the work inherits, disputes, derives from and offers in its own name. Vaikharī: the spoken-and-inspected surface of the one descent.\nThe register's records are carried by the Episteme Expression; held here as presence, referenced not restaged.\nSource of record: submission-package/essay/symbolon/README.md @ dbf3b17",
