        {
          "id": "editorial",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "RETURN · SYMBOLON · PARĀ",
          "title": "0/1 = 1/0",
          "italic": "two orientations of one relation",
          "body": "The held registers return to the whole without fusion. The equality `0/1 = 1/0` keeps both orientations active: the whole gives the registers their room, and what the registers articulate returns as the whole's own self-knowledge. Symbolon remains parā — the whole unsayable form — because nothing held in it is diminished into a part of it.\nTraversal continues in the companion Expression: the eight roots in spine order, the four heads, the spine-index (roz-symbolon-spine).\nSource of record: submission-package/essay/symbolon/README.md @ dbf3b17",
